-o025"]},{"id":"luxun-m-p012-luxun-p0026","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["luxun-q-p012"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-f21c8410cd234a240bbe","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及骆统，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-0f68b4116d20cb83af4e"]},{"id":"yululu-m-193e3eac6956c5b973a0","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及骆统，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-f2f31cb4850e7772cc96"]},{"id":"yululu-m-8f16624a270e05090e47","kind":"mention","text":"评曰：抗明大义，辞切理至，值权方闭不开","evidence":["yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207"]},{"id":"yululu-m-21717dbdc95102252712","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及骆统，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["yululu-q-a7c835f82230b992cee9"]},{"id":"yululu-m-243371f711805929bdd2","kind":"mention","text":"育举偏将军乌伤骆统聪明大略、忠直謇谔","evidence":["yululu-q-a10cdb7af3f03e686cf1"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"luxun-e-o025b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9aa843011c5bd123fd7c","layer":"original","quote":"又备既住白帝，徐盛、潘璋、宋谦等各竞表言“备必可擒，乞复攻之”。权以问逊，逊与朱然、骆统以为：“曹丕大合士众，外托助国讨备，内实有奸心。谨决计辄还。”","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o025","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-9aa843011c5bd123fd7c","layer":"original","quote":"权大笑称善。加拜逊辅国将军，领荆州牧，即改封江陵侯。又备既住白帝，徐盛、潘璋、宋谦等各竞表言“备必可擒，乞复攻之”。权以问逊，逊与朱然、骆统以为：“曹丕大合士众，外托助国讨备，内实有奸心。谨决计辄还。”无几，魏军果出，三方受敌也〖11〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-p012","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-b7e7f86fd5e01c0c79fc","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《会稽典录》曰：“谢渊字休德。少修德操，躬秉耒耜；既无戚容，又不易虑：由是知名。举孝廉，稍迁至建武将军。虽在戎旅，犹垂意人物。骆统子，名秀，被门庭之谤；众论狐疑，莫能证明。渊闻之叹息曰：‘公绪早夭，同盟所哀。闻其子志行明辩，而被暗昧之谤；望诸夫子烈然高断，而各怀迟疑，非所望也。’秀卒见明，无复瑕玷，终为显士；渊之力也。”","attribution":"《会稽典录》","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4bb4ccb93c53bcb6a59d","start":0,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-94d58550e3abb558ad13","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：黄初四年（公元 223）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":394,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2950ca88709b8c25fb44","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o038","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-62c39b4b73d5f8874468","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“丧乱以来，兵革未戢〖2〗。天下之人，互相残杀。今海内初定，敢有私复仇者，皆族之〖3〗！”筑南巡台于宛。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":391,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o063b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":55,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o063","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-81e074e42b79f01d129f","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，曹真分军据江陵中州〖2〗。是月，城江夏山〖3〗。改《四分》〖4〗，用《乾象历》〖5〗。﹝一﹞三月，曹仁遣将军常雕等，以兵五千，乘油船〖6〗，晨渡濡须中州；仁子泰，因引军急攻朱桓，桓兵拒之；遣将军严圭等击破雕等。是月，魏军皆退。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-00d4dee130e8d47c5d56","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-91b7bc0c3caf0cb9ec9a","layer":"original","quote":"夫宿恶之民，放逸山险则为劲寇，将置平土则为健兵；故温念在欲取宿恶，以除劲寇之害，而增健兵之锐也。但自错落〖26〗，功不副言。然计其送兵，以比许晏〖27〗：数之多少，温不减之；用之强羸〖28〗，温不下之；至于迟速，温不后之；故得及秋冬之月，赴有警之期，不敢忘恩而遗力也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0297ab657f4a39a55e62","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0c3d93eef4e39f30e22c","layer":"original","quote":"事嫡母甚谨。时饥荒，乡里及远方客多有困乏，统为之饮食衰少〖7〗。其姊仁爱有行，寡归无子；见统，甚哀之，数问其故。统曰：“士大夫糟糠不足〖8〗，我何心独饱！”姊曰：“诚如是，何不告我，而自苦若此？”乃自以私粟与统，又以告母。母亦贤之，遂使分施：由是显名。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-03e08273c7afc5c15008","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-5df24cbddc39f5362b08","layer":"original","quote":"今强敌未殄，海内未乂〖9〗；三军有无已之役，江境有不释之备。征赋调数，由来积纪〖10〗；加以殃疫死丧之灾，郡县荒虚，田畴芜旷。听闻属城，民户浸寡〖11〗；又多残老，少有丁夫。闻此之日，心若焚燎。思寻所由，小民无知，既有安土重迁之性，且又前后出为兵者；生则困苦无有温饱，死则委弃骸骨不反。是以尤用恋本〖12〗，畏远同之于死。每有征发，羸谨居家重累者先见输送；小有财货，倾居行赂〖13〗，不顾穷尽；轻剽者则迸入险阻〖14〗，党就群恶。百姓虚竭，嗷然愁扰〖15〗。愁扰则不营业〖16〗，不营业则致穷困，致穷困则不乐生，故口腹急则奸心动而携叛多也〖17〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":274,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-078e7d96511d9d53f444","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d8b86bf310bbd921823d","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：庄周云“名者公器也，不可以多取”；张温之废，岂其取名之多乎？多之为弊，古贤既知之矣。是以远见之士，退藏于密；不使名浮于德，不以华伤其实。既不能被褐韫宝，挫廉逃誉；使才映一世，声盖人上。冲用之道，庸可暂替！温则反之，能无败乎？权既疾温名盛，而骆统方骤言其美，至云“卓跞冠群，炜晔曜世，世人未有及之者也”。斯何异燎之方盛，又#膏以炽之哉！","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38557237fd615b1b7733","start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0affee8b0010e5962dd0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ebcb79b109e5dc0f900a","layer":"original","quote":"温实心无他情，事无逆迹；但年纪尚少，镇重尚浅；而戴赫烈之宠〖6〗，体卓伟之才〖7〗；亢臧否之谈〖8〗，效褒贬之议〖9〗。于是务势者妒其宠，争名者嫉其才；玄默者非其谈〖10〗，瑕衅者讳其议〖11〗：此臣下所当详辨，明朝所当究察也〖12〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":238,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0ca4708b54c8c41f29c4","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-7be0ec780cf922d0b19d","layer":"original","quote":"统志在补察〖11〗，苟所闻见，夕不待旦。常劝权以“尊贤接士，勤求损益〖12〗；飨赐之日，可人人别进〖13〗，问其燥湿〖14〗；加以密意，诱喻使言，察其志趣；令皆感恩戴义，怀欲报之心”。权纳用焉","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":308,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0e1bf538d6e9fb148854","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ecdbf592c43420473bd0","layer":"original","quote":"凡此数者，校之于事既不合，参之于众亦不验。臣窃念人君虽有圣哲之姿，非常之智；然以一人之身，御兆民之众〖48〗，从层宫之内，瞰四国之外〖49〗，照群下之情，求万机之理，犹未易周也；固当听察群下之言，以广聪明之烈。今者人非温既殷勤〖50〗，臣是温又契阔〖51〗；辞则俱巧，意则俱至；各自言欲为国，谁其言欲为私？仓猝之间，犹难即别。然以殿下之聪睿，察讲论之曲直；若潜神留思，纤粗研核，情何嫌而不宣，事何昧而不昭哉！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":244,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":204,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-12e54bb28545c8b8ae82","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"黄武初，曹仁攻濡须，使别将常雕等袭中洲","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-1591980ea7c33e1556c2","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"以随陆逊破蜀军于宜都，迁偏将军","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-1c67d6cedf55d9d40648","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"统与严圭共拒破之，封新阳亭侯","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-23a9199f917b9c79207f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-4484f1933d892ab08a5f","layer":"original","quote":"温之到蜀，共誉殷礼，虽臣无境外之交，亦有可原也。境外之交，谓无君命而私相从，非国事而阴相闻者也〖29〗；若以命行，既修君好，因叙己情，亦使臣之道也。故孔子使邻国〖30〗，则有私觌之礼〖31〗；季子聘诸夏〖32〗，亦有燕谈之义也〖33〗。古人有言：欲知其君，观其所使；见其下之明明，知其上之赫赫。温若誉礼，能使彼叹之；诚所以昭我臣之多良，明使之得其人，显国美于异境，扬君命于他邦。是以晋赵文子之盟于宋也〖34〗，称随会于屈建〖35〗；楚王孙圉之使于晋也〖36〗，誉左史于赵鞅〖37〗。亦向他国之辅，而叹本邦之臣；经传美之以光国，而不讥之以外交〖38〗也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":242,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":276,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-265f37bbbc25603a471d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-32c3feafa03918cfeed0","layer":"original","quote":"臣闻君国者〖2〗，以据疆土为强富，制威福为尊贵，曜德义为荣显，永世胤为丰祚〖3〗。然财须民生〖4〗，强赖民力，威恃民势，福由民殖，德俟民茂〖5〗，义以民行：六者既备，然后应天受祚，保族宜邦。《书》曰：‘众非后无能胥以宁〖6〗，后非众无以辟四方〖7〗。’推是言之，则民以君安，君以民济〖8〗：不易之道也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-2c3ac324b7846af1540d","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9a0daa2cc9276ae3ffa0","layer":"original","quote":"妻以从兄辅女","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-3020760336a9e483ce73","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cc13454ec9d6ad18cae1","layer":"original","quote":"王靖内不忧时，外不趋事〖39〗；温弹之不私〖40〗，推之不假〖41〗。于是与靖遂为大怨，此其尽节之明验也〖42〗。靖兵众之势，干任之用，皆胜于贾原、蒋康；温尚不容私以安于靖，岂敢卖恩以协原、康邪〖43〗？又原在职不勤，当事不堪〖44〗；温数对以丑色〖45〗，弹以急声〖46〗：若其诚欲卖恩作乱，则亦不必贪原也〖47〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-3dbcde5d4060ac469893","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0c3d93eef4e39f30e22c","layer":"original","quote":"其姊仁爱有行，寡归无子；见统，甚哀之，数问其故。统曰：“士大夫糟糠不足〖8〗，我何心独饱！”姊曰：“诚如是，何不告我，而自苦若此？”乃自以私粟与统，又以告母。母亦贤之，遂使分施：由是显名","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-48b471303fe96aeae514","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-c6239e240496e568c2c0","layer":"original","quote":"数陈便宜，前后书数十上；所言皆善，文多故不悉载","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-4f2dbde5da0d02bee0b0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-3db74075292c3c0b5d49","layer":"original","quote":"温非亲臣，臣非爱温者也。昔之君子，皆抑私忿，以增君明。彼独行之于前，臣耻废之于后；故遂发宿怀于今日〖52〗，纳愚言于圣（德）〔听〕。实尽心于明朝，非有念于温身也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":245,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-50d3ef185cb9286c259e","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-139fef0974ff4bd2c7d6","layer":"pei","quote":"陵卒，僮客土田或见侵夺；骆统为陵家讼之，求与丁览、卜清等为比：权许焉","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0fc9542c4adb6310827d","start":353,"end":387,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-54672e7dd0747c7b2899","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0c4cd09a50ba4f746491","layer":"original","quote":"夫国之有民，犹水之有舟；停则以安，扰则以危；愚而不可欺，弱而不可胜。是以圣王重焉，祸福由之；故与民消息〖23〗，观时制政。方今长吏，亲民之职，惟以办具为能〖24〗，取过目前之急〖25〗；少复以恩惠为治，副称殿下天覆之仁，勤恤之德者。官民政俗，日以凋弊；渐以陵迟〖26〗，势不可久！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-590d9d3b3ba6acaf9b2e","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-c6239e240496e568c2c0","layer":"original","quote":"尤以占募在民间长恶败俗〖31〗，生离叛之心，急宜绝置〖32〗；权与相反覆〖33〗，终遂行之","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-5c963d4bf1f769f1360c","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9a0daa2cc9276ae3ffa0","layer":"original","quote":"权嘉之，召为功曹，行骑都尉","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-722887f0e36a534122cd","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-5e18bfba08447dfc58dd","layer":"original","quote":"夫治疾及其未笃〖27〗，除患贵其未深；愿殿下少以万机余闲，留神思省。补复荒虚，深图远计；育残余之民，阜人财之用〖28〗；参曜三光〖29〗，等崇天地〖30〗。臣统之大愿，足以死而不朽矣。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-79159578c2386c9cf627","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-581a4d021b40312d2429","layer":"original","quote":"出为建忠中郎将〖15〗，领武射吏三千人","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-7ef0bf8075c9e36cba2f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab55cf127161ffea0ef3","layer":"original","quote":"后为濡须督","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-97244524917230960a0f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-a4a69d540e16a255f594","layer":"original","quote":"昔贾谊，至忠之臣也；汉文〖13〗，大明之君也。然而绛、灌一言〖14〗，贾谊远退。何者？疾之者深，谮之者巧也。然而误闻于天下〖15〗，失彰于后世；故孔子曰‘为君难，为臣不易〖16〗’也。温虽智非纵横〖17〗，武非虓虎〖18〗；然其弘雅之素，英秀之德，文章之采，论议之辨；卓跞冠群〖19〗，炜晔曜世〖20〗：世人未有及之者也。故论温才即可惜，言罪则可恕。若忍威烈以赦盛德，宥贤才以敦大业；固明朝之休光〖21〗，四方之丽观也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":239,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":210,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a0bcbd91d8520add2121","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-27f6d050ea4a434c6b70","layer":"original","quote":"骆统字公绪，会稽乌伤人也〖1〗。父俊，官至陈相〖2〗，为袁术所害。﹝一﹞统母改适〖3〗，为华歆小妻〖4〗。统时八岁，遂与亲客归会稽，其母送之。拜辞上车，面而不顾〖5〗。其母泣涕于后，御者曰〖6〗：“夫人犹在也。”统曰：“不欲增母思，故不顾耳。”","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a10cdb7af3f03e686cf1","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-19e656ddf062438a74f1","layer":"pei","quote":"濮阳府君曰：‘御史所云，既闻其人；亚斯以下，书佐宁识之乎？’育曰：‘瞻仰景行，敢不识之！近者太守上虞陈业，洁身清行，志怀霜雪，贞亮之信，同操柳下。遭汉中微，委官弃禄；遁迹黟、歙，以求其志；高邈妙踪，天下所闻。故桓文〔林〕遗之尺牍之书，比竟三高。其聪明大略，忠直謇谔，则侍御史余姚虞翻，偏将军乌伤骆统。其渊懿纯德，则太子少傅山阴阚泽，学通行茂，作帝师儒。其雄姿武毅，立功当世，则后将军贺齐，勋成绩著。其探极秘术，言合神明，则太史令上虞吴范。其文章之士，立言粲盛，则御史中丞句章任奕，鄱阳太守章安虞翔，各驰文檄，晔若春荣。处士（邓）〔� 〕卢叙，弟犯公宪，自杀乞代。吴宁斯敦、山阴祁庚、上虞樊正，咸代父死罪。其女则松阳柳朱，永宁（瞿）〔翟〕素：或一醮守节，丧身不顾；或遭寇劫贼，死不亏行。皆近世之事，尚在耳目。’府君曰：‘皆海内之英也！吾闻秦始皇二十五年，以吴越地为会稽郡，治吴；汉封诸侯王。以何年复为郡，而分治于此？’育对曰：‘刘贾为荆王，贾为英布所杀，又以刘濞为吴王。景帝四年，濞反，诛；乃复为郡，治于吴。元鼎五年，除东越，因以其地为治，并属于此，而立东部都尉；后徙章安；阳朔元年，又徙治鄞；或有寇害，复徒句章。到永建四年，刘府君上书：浙江之北，以为吴郡；会稽还治山阴。自永建四年岁在己巳，以至今年，积百二十九岁。’府君称善。","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d74a16d867d430187c4b","start":0,"end":563,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a2e6cbbb18cf63a40513","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-27f6d050ea4a434c6b70","layer":"original","quote":"统时八岁，遂与亲客归会稽，其母送之。拜辞上车，面而不顾〖5〗。其母泣涕于后，御者曰〖6〗：“夫人犹在也。”统曰：“不欲增母思，故不顾耳","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":305,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a2e8f799c4979424fb40","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-0c3d93eef4e39f30e22c","layer":"original","quote":"时饥荒，乡里及远方客多有困乏，统为之饮食衰少","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":306,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a794c61df5c50bab7166","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-8e00e7a7b6190440ff79","layer":"original","quote":"年三十六，黄武七年卒","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-a7c835f82230b992cee9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-139fef0974ff4bd2c7d6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《会稽典录》曰：“览字孝连。八岁而孤，家又单微；清身立行，用意不苟。推财从弟，以义让称。仕郡至功曹，守始平长。为人精微洁净，门无杂宾。孙权深贵待之。未及擢用，会病卒；甚见痛惜，殊其门户。览子固，字子贱。本名密，避滕密，改作固。固在襁褓中，阚泽见而异之，曰：‘此儿后必致公辅。’固少丧父，独与母居；家贫守约，色养致敬。族弟孤弱，与同寒温。翻与固同僚书曰：‘丁子贱塞渊好德，堂构克举，野无遗薪。斯之为懿，其美优矣。令德之后，惟此君嘉耳！’历显位。孙休时固为左御史大夫。孙皓即位，迁司徒。皓悖虐，固与陆凯、孟宗同心忧国。年七十六卒。子弥，字钦远。仕晋，至梁州刺史。孙潭，光禄大夫。徐陵字元大。历三县长，所在著称。迁零陵太守。时朝廷俟以列卿之位。故翻书曰：‘元大受上卿之遇；叔向在晋，未若于今。’其见重如此。陵卒，僮客土田或见侵夺；骆统为陵家讼之，求与丁览、卜清等为比：权许焉。陵子平，字伯先。童龀知名，翻甚爱之，屡称叹焉。诸葛恪为丹杨太守，讨山越；以平威重思虑，可与效力，请平为丞。稍迁武昌左部督，倾心接物，士卒皆为尽力。初，平为恪从事，意甚薄；及恪辅政，待平益疏。恪被害，子建亡走，为平部曲所得；平使遣去，别为他军所获。平两妇归宗，敬奉情过乎厚。其行义敦笃，皆此类也。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0fc9542c4adb6310827d","start":0,"end":536,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ad60f2dd2968f1d25844","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-581a4d021b40312d2429","layer":"original","quote":"及凌统死，复领其兵","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":309,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":24,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-c884bdbd6cb4a7c3dcab","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ee9826979bb807856355","layer":"original","quote":"是时征役繁数，重以疫疠〖1〗，民户损耗。统上疏曰：","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":329,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-cc5c2cb7da7f00eaf506","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9a0daa2cc9276ae3ffa0","layer":"original","quote":"统年二十，试为乌程相。民户过万，咸叹其惠理","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":307,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-e631bc8aaa000678a1b1","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-2980ba0a1e92ec4ad20b","layer":"original","quote":"国家之于暨艳，不纳之忌族〖22〗，犹等之平民；是故先见用于朱治，次见举于众人，中见任于明朝，亦见交于温也。君臣之义〖23〗，义之最重；朋友之交，交之最轻者也。国家不嫌于艳为最重之义〖24〗，是以温亦不嫌与艳为最轻之交也；时世宠之于上〖25〗，温窃亲之于下也。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-e8d042a74428891517aa","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-aac665f882e8b7f40652","layer":"original","quote":"权感统言，深加意焉","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f0387787fcaa46d8b349","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-9aa65f678301d68d473a","layer":"original","quote":"又闻民间，非居处小能自供，生产儿子多不起养〖18〗；屯田贫兵，亦多弃子。天则生之，而父母杀之：既惧干逆和气〖19〗，感动阴阳；且惟殿下开基建国，乃无穷之业也，强邻大敌非造次所灭〖20〗，疆埸常守非期月之戍〖21〗，而兵民减耗，后生不育〖22〗，非所以历远年，致成功也！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f0734b39762c61b9585b","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-ab5f619c61e69ac595e3","layer":"original","quote":"伏惟殿下〖2〗，天生明德，神启圣心；招髦秀于四方〖3〗，署俊乂于宫朝。多士既受普笃之恩〖4〗，张温又蒙最隆之施。而温自招罪谴，孤负荣遇〖5〗；念其如此，诚可悲疚。然臣周旋之间，为国观听；深知其状，故密陈其理。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":237,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f2c083caa7bec7299207","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-88aca22865401281bdfd","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：虞翻古之狂直〖1〗，固难免乎末世〖2〗；然权不能容，非旷宇也〖3〗！陆绩之于扬《玄》〖4〗，是仲尼之左丘明〖5〗，老聃之严周矣〖6〗；以瑚琏之器〖7〗，而作守南越〖8〗：不亦贼夫人欤〖9〗？张温才藻俊茂；而智防未备，用致艰患。骆统抗明大义〖10〗，辞切理至，值权方闭不开。陆瑁笃义规谏，君子有称焉。吾粲、朱据遭罹屯蹇〖11〗，以正丧身：悲夫！","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":490,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-f2f31cb4850e7772cc96","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-c2c64315bc36b9d61208","layer":"original","quote":"将军骆统表理温曰〖1〗：","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-0f68b4116d20cb83af4e","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-bd3ae6c16dfaabd1ba21","layer":"original","quote":"泽州里先辈丹杨唐固，亦修身积学，称为儒者。著《国语》、《公羊》、《穀梁传》注〖18〗，讲授常数十人。权为吴王，拜固议郎。自陆逊、张温、骆统等，皆拜之〖19〗。黄武四年为尚书仆射，卒。﹝二﹞","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o021","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-6f9ad1f5d575a9d3f55f","layer":"original","quote":"章武三年春，先主于永安病笃〖1〗；召亮于成都，属以后事。谓亮曰：“君才十倍曹丕，必能安国，终定大事。若嗣子可辅，辅之；如其不才〖2〗，君可自取〖3〗。”亮涕泣曰：“臣敢竭股肱之力〖4〗，效忠贞之节，继之以死！”先主又为诏敕后主曰：“汝与丞相从事〖5〗，事之如父。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":131,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
